msgid "It's a painting of POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_2F/scripts.inc:315
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_2F_Text_NewPaintingsSurprisedMe"
msgid ""
"I've been away awhile, so the new\n"
"paintings up here surprised me.\p"
"I wish someone would paint my POKéMON\n"
"this pretty.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_2F/scripts.inc:321
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_2F_Text_NewPaintingsRatherAmusing"
msgid ""
"Well… So this is where they show\n"
"the topical POKéMON paintings.\p"
"I see, these new paintings are indeed\n"
"rather amusing.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_2F/scripts.inc:327
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_2F_Text_ThesePaintingsOfYourPokemon"
msgid ""
"Wow, is that right?\n"
"These paintings are of your POKéMON.\p"
"Isn't that just the ultimate joy for\n"
"a TRAINER?$"
msgstr ""
